{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54061","headline":"示洞山偈 · 隐山和尚","name":"示洞山偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青山白云父，白云青山儿。\n白云终日依（一作「倚」），青山都（一作「总」）不知。\n欲知此中意，寸步不相离。\n（见《祖堂集》卷二十）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"隐山和尚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54061.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54061","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}